OL,3,AWhy Moscow is staying tight-lipped on
OL,4,ATrump's energy ceasefire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Sunday, US President Donald Trump
OL,7,Fannounced that Russia and Ukraine had
OL,8,Fagreed a ceasefire on strikes on energy
OL,9,Finfrastructure "effective immediately".
OL,10,FUkraine's Volodymyr Zelensky suggested
OL,11,Fit was "news for me", while Russia has
OL,12,Fnot commented publicly.
OL,14,FSo who is saying what?
OL,16,FDonald Trump says an energy ceasefire
OL,17,Fhas been agreed.
OL,19,FKyiv asks: Has it? It is willing to
OL,20,Fsign up ` if Russia does.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
